{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dragon Jump</strong> is the love baby of a game jam idea and my long dream to make learning about AI more approachable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game you can either: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">master the dragon jump and compete on the leaderboard for the best time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">connect via an external script and train your own AI to beat all those sweaty tryhards </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed as a single player, single input precision platformer. Your task? Get to the portal AS-FAST-AS-YOU-CAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too easy? Don't worry I'm working on a lot of traps that would fix that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too hard? Git gud and learn how to program an AI to get you past the level you're struggling with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471710?t=1746088616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471710?t=1746088616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471710/4644ce920c348f35d401337b517b3e8068b50354/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746088616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471710/4644ce920c348f35d401337b517b3e8068b50354/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746088616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dragon Jump</strong> is the love baby of a game jam idea and my long dream to make learning about AI more approachable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game you can either: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">master the dragon jump and compete on the leaderboard for the best time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">connect via an external script and train your own AI to beat all those sweaty tryhards </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed as a single player, single input precision platformer. Your task? Get to the portal AS-FAST-AS-YOU-CAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too easy? Don't worry I'm working on a lot of traps that would fix that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too hard? Git gud and learn how to program an AI to get you past the level you're struggling with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["2BytesGoat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471710/header.jpg?t=1746088616","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"name":"Dragon Jump","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / AMD Radeon R5<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li><